    "notes": [
      "Resolves the four-vs-five primary-navigation mismatch explicitly deferred by DEC-02, DEC-03 and DEC-09.",
      "Persistent NativeTabs become Today, History, Goals and Profile in the approved ATLAS-DESIGN-001 order.",
      "Business Hub remains the Profile root; Context and Settings remain available as pushed Profile-detail routes rather than persistent tabs.",
      "History becomes a true tab root while retaining the public/deep-link path /history because Expo Router route groups are URL-transparent.",
